{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This top down 2.5D ghost story mystery will take the player through a Louisiana inspired neighborhood haunting.\u00a0The short story format allows for both easy accessibility and let's you discover up to 5 endings without the burden of a 30+ hour RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/image.png?t=1744221927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using Spirit Vision, Clair leaves their body in an astral form to explore the history of the place and dig deeper into the truth of the festering catalyst of its haunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/MG_GIF_spiritvision_01.gif?t=1744221927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The recently developed neighborhood of Myrtle Grove is filled with an awkward anxiety. The source is the ghost, but is there more affecting the safety or social dynamics of the community?\u00a0Explore the subdivision as Clair and talk to the curious batch of residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/image2.png?t=1744221927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Behind every lingering spirit is an unresolved tragedy. Do you have the courage to find it?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3141000?t=1744221927","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744221927","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/020106d387686d82b4f313a43a1ea2f6bf2d740a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744221927","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.stea